# Public HTTPS for the Deepgram entry, installed as /etc/caddy/sites/summit-deepgram.caddy by
# deploy/deepgram_agent/deploy.sh. Its own hostname, so the Retell site stays untouched. Only the
# bridge's two routes are public: Twilio's webhook (signature checked) and the media stream
# (keyed per call).
